# Deployment artifacts are byte-significant: the deployable source bytes are
# what GenVM stores, what the size budget measures, and what the evaluator code
# hash binds. A CRLF checkout on Windows silently inflates every artifact by one
# byte per line, which breaks artifact/source parity and the outer-size gate.
# Normalise the whole repository to LF in the index and in every working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
